AWS CloudOps Project — Video Demonstration

This video demonstrates my hands-on AWS project, Highly Available and Scalable Web Application Infrastructure on AWS.

Features Demonstrated

- Apache web application hosted on Amazon EC2
- Application Load Balancer (ALB) for traffic distribution
- EC2 Auto Scaling Group deployed across two Availability Zones
- Automatic EC2 instance replacement and recovery
- CPU-based automatic scale-out from 2 to 3 instances
- Automatic scale-in from 3 to 2 instances
- Amazon CloudWatch metrics, monitoring, and scaling alarms

Project Outcome

Successfully implemented and tested a highly available and scalable AWS web infrastructure, demonstrating load balancing, multi-AZ deployment, automatic instance recovery, and CPU-based Auto Scaling.

AWS Services: Amazon EC2, Application Load Balancer, EC2 Auto Scaling, Amazon VPC, Amazon CloudWatch, and IAM.
